abstract: >-
  Language-agnostic schemas and TypeScript tooling for TILDA bicycle-infrastructure
  (and future roads, parking, CQI) data: controlled vocabularies, fixtures, and a
  portable processor that mirrors the TILDA LUA pipeline.
